## 9 · KPI Stats Bar Values (computed from JSON)

```
emp   = total passenger count across all routes
routes = route count
guards = routes where IsGuardAllocated === true
snEmp  = passengers where IsLate === true
su    = "{used}/{total}" from sum TotalSeatUsed / sum (TotalSeatUsed + AvailablePassengerSeats)
dist  = sum RouteDistanceKm (rounded)
extra = sum AverageDetourKm * route count (rounded)
fleet = unique cab types (mock: "Sedan / Innova")
```

