# Route Maker — Real API Integration Guide

## What changed & why

The API response (`route-analytics`) uses a different shape than the existing mock data:

| API field                            | Mock field                        |
| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- |
| `dsId`                               | `VehicleId`                       |
| `passengers[].empId`                 | `Passenger.Id`                    |
| `passengers[].lat/lng`               | `Passenger.Lat/Lng`               |
| `routePolyline` (on trip)            | `RoutePolyline` (on VehicleRoute) |
| `totalDuration` (string, minutes)    | `RouteDurationMinutes`            |
| No `Waypoints`                       | `Waypoints[]` — synthesised       |
| No `IsLate` / `EfficiencyPercentage` | Derived from `extraDistanceKm`    |

Three new files handle the translation; **no existing files are modified**.

