## What the adapter derives

| VehicleRoute field     | Derived from                                                           |
| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `EfficiencyPercentage` | `(routedKm - extraKm) / routedKm × 100`                                |
| `AverageDetourKm`      | mean of `extraDistanceKm` across passengers                            |
| `Waypoints`            | one waypoint per passenger + terminal Office waypoint                  |
| `CabDepartureTime`     | last ETA minus `totalDuration` minutes                                 |
| `RouteDurationMinutes` | `parseFloat(totalDuration)`                                            |
| `Passenger.EmployeeID` | `"EMP-{empId}"`                                                        |
| `Passenger.Firstname`  | `"Employee {empId}"` — replace with a lookup if you have employee data |
| `Passenger.Gender`     | defaults to `'M'` — not in API                                         |
| `Passenger.IsLate`     | defaults to `false` — not in API                                       |

